{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CombatBox is a war simulation game where AI factions fight each other.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI Battles</strong>: Engage in battles where soldiers fight for survival. Strategy is key to gaining the upper hand.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/extras/71dfcb72871fd2d7a12dec01ac063c33.avif?t=1768413917\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limb Dismemberment &amp; Blood System</strong>: Experience the harshness of war with realistic limb dismemberment and blood effects that heighten the intensity of battle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/extras/aab79583ad29a181580897cabc75f035.avif?t=1768413917\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Bullets</strong>: Bullets follow realistic trajectories, providing a challenging and immersive combat experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/extras/623b87494debd2efeea85b173224f632.avif?t=1768413917\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Weaponry</strong>: Equip yourself with a wide array of weapons, each suited for different tactics and combat scenarios.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/extras/7134db81972f1fd03d4f076bef914929.avif?t=1768413917\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upcoming Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mod Support</strong>: Expand the game with custom content, allowing players to create and share new scenarios and experiences.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/c387d8b97d17d19a31d1456cd6c0e3516d34c56b.jpg"},{"name":"Stimulant Overdose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/525a4f224e3b4392bf3b0a4079a91066d9ffcba3.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Medic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/d46ad89149b4d17946baa8cac244b5023bb8d36d.jpg"},{"name":"The Punisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/208fcc3ab69951d78d328f8490a478e1ef3d3ddc.jpg"},{"name":"Disorderly Conduct","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/99a982859a907ceae62de70fdb7087bee77e773c.jpg"},{"name":"Canned Meat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/51378b2449dfcaa55dd854f32bc2bbdbae9e25d8.jpg"},{"name":"Maximum Metabolism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/e9d60d4b5c5370535252ce86c25f40fadd2d284a.jpg"},{"name":"Stay with me...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/2946867aa1dd3be1ee6d92b7a522dd21cbd07f24.jpg"},{"name":"Zeroed In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/1fe8d17ef24f41b77d7189c45b0a6a9c92fa2e4f.jpg"},{"name":"Tainted Residue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591890/95592f21772a729f4ef1219ab26f8e849de82106.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591890?t=1768413917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591890?t=1768413917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/7b9bff7ebf8a6f6d32dbe4e6ff5b7ea87cfb0b7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768413917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/7b9bff7ebf8a6f6d32dbe4e6ff5b7ea87cfb0b7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768413917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game does not contain any sexual or nudity-related content.\r\n\r\nIt features violent combat with blood effects and dismemberment. However, there are no depictions of internal organs or excessive gore. Blood appears as dark red splatter during combat and may remain on walls or the environment.\r\n\r\nPlayers can disable gore via a \u201cGore\u201d checkbox in the game settings. When gore is disabled, dismemberment is turned off and blood effects are replaced with colorful, non-realistic visual effects (e.g. fireworks-style bursts).\r\n\r\nThe game also provides visual examples comparing the gore on/off setting for clarity.\r\n\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3704550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CombatBox is a war simulation game where AI factions fight each other.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI Battles</strong>: Engage in battles where soldiers fight for survival. Strategy is key to gaining the upper hand.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/extras/71dfcb72871fd2d7a12dec01ac063c33.avif?t=1768413917\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 cl